    "normalized_text": "Claire Delaunay\nHead of Product Operations\nParis, France | claire.delaunay@example.com | +33 6 12 34 56 78\nProfile\nOperator with nine years of experience scaling post-sales systems, launch readiness, executive reporting, and cross-functional process design across B2B SaaS teams from Series A to public-company scale.\nCore Strengths\nArea\nDepth\nEvidence\nLaunch operations\nExpert\nBuilt launch control rooms and readiness reviews for 14 major releases.\nExecutive reporting\nExpert\nOwned weekly operating packs for CEO, CRO, and board observers.\nSystems design\nAdvanced\nConnected CRM, support, and product telemetry into a unified review workflow.\nExperience Highlights\nLed the operating cadence for a revenue organization growing from $12M to $48M ARR while reducing manual reporting effort by more than 70%.\nPartnered with product, finance, and success leadership to establish a single launch readiness score used in weekly executive reviews.\nSelected Deliverables\nDeliverable\nImpact\nDetail\nExecutive operating pack\nWeekly\nAligned revenue, support, and launch signals in one document.\nReadiness dashboard\nLaunch quality\nReduced release-day surprises by making blockers visible early.\nAutomation playbooks\nScale\nTurned recurring document work into reusable systems.\nSignature\nCalm under load. Strong operator. Excellent writer.",
